{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-belkin-boostcharge-usb-c-bpb002-and-playa-usb-c-pb0003-power-banks-2511-0225","content_id":"5354e4de-05d6-4585-832a-9779534d423e","description":"Product Recall for Belkin BoostCharge USB-C BPB002 and Playa USB-C PB0003 Power Banks presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"7f307c0c-2ed4-4c48-87e9-c3617969eb8a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-04T14:28:11+00:00","id":"7f307c0c-2ed4-4c48-87e9-c3617969eb8a","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-04T14:28:11+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69319a7b0cf0b7e681ff4270/2511-0225-product-recall-belkin-power-banks__2_.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Belkin BoostCharge USB-C BPB002 and Playa USB-C PB0003 Power Banks</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as the lithium-ion batteries can overheat whilst in use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Chargers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Belkin</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>BoostCharge BPB002 and Playa PB0003</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcodes</td>\n      <td>745883797622, 745883806751, 745883797639, 745883806768, 745883797646</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Vietnam</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Portable power bank with lithium-ion battery cells. The model number can be located on the back or side of the Belkin device. Only the BPB002 and PB0003 models are affected. Affected products have been sold by Belkin or by other retailers, including TKMaxx.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_7f307c0c-2ed4-4c48-87e9-c3617969eb8a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69319a7b0cf0b7e681ff4270/2511-0225-product-recall-belkin-power-banks__2_.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as the lithium-ion batteries can overheat whilst in use. This can lead to localised smoking, melting and/or a risk of fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users. </p>\n\n<p>Consumers should stop using the product immediately and complete the recall form on the <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.belkin.com/support-article/?articleNum=337290\">Belkin website</a> to receive a full refund or replacement. </p>\n\n<p>Products purchased via TK Maxx can be returned to any TK Maxx store for a full refund or replacement. For further information on the TK Maxx recall, please visit <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">this link.</a>  </p>\n\n<p>If disposing of the product, consumers should ensure this is done safely via their local household waste disposal site. Consumers should check first with their local centre if they accept this type of battery. For further information on household waste, access the following Gov.uk webpage  <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/dispose-household-waste\">https://www.gov.uk/dispose-household-waste</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0225</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Adding link to the TK Maxx recall page, and information for consumers who have purchased via this retailer. ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-04T14:28:49Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-26T09:16:46Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-26","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-26T09:16:46+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-belkin-boostcharge-usb-c-bpb002-and-playa-usb-c-pb0003-power-banks-2511-0225","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-belkin-boostcharge-usb-c-bpb002-and-playa-usb-c-pb0003-power-banks-2511-0225","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-belkin-boostcharge-usb-c-bpb002-and-playa-usb-c-pb0003-power-banks-2511-0225","content_id":"5354e4de-05d6-4585-832a-9779534d423e","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-04T14:28:49Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Belkin BoostCharge USB-C BPB002 and Playa USB-C PB0003 Power Banks (2511-0225)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-belkin-boostcharge-usb-c-bpb002-and-playa-usb-c-pb0003-power-banks-2511-0225","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product